  "description": "Replacement of existing windows with modern double glazed PVCu casements to match existing",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;The proposed replacement uPVC windows and door, by reason of their detailed design, finish, and materials, would result in a harmful impact on the character and appearance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;of the host building and the terrace it forms part of, thereby having an adverse impact on the visual amenities of the street scene.&amp;nbsp; It would, therefore, be contrary to policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and the advice contained within Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
